DATA

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the scripts, the
workflow and the settings files in config/ (*.json), except the data and
third-party files named below.

The map data is NOT covered by it. The files in config/boundaries/, the
coordinates in config/gate_routes.json and config/geocoder_gate.json, the
spot_checks and city_labels of config/basemap.json, the routing tiles
(valhalla_tiles.tar), nogo_zones.geojson, the offline map (georgia.pmtiles),
the search database (georgia_geocoder.sqlite.gz) and every other file
derived from OpenStreetMap are (c) OpenStreetMap contributors and are
available under the Open Database License 1.0 (ODbL):
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Attribution: "© OpenStreetMap contributors", https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY

config/sprites/maki/ (Maki 8.2.0, https://github.com/mapbox/maki) and
config/sprites/temaki/ (Temaki 5.13.0, https://github.com/rapideditor/temaki)
are dedicated to the public domain under CC0-1.0; their texts lie alongside.
The badge designs and sprite sheets made from them (sprites.zip) are under
the MIT licence above.

config/glyphs/ holds the SIL Open Font License 1.1 texts of Noto Sans
Georgian and Noto Sans (Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors). The fonts
are downloaded by the workflow, never stored here; the released glyphs.zip
is made from them and is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 too.

georgia.pmtiles also follows the OpenMapTiles schema, CC-BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/): a map drawn from it must
visibly credit "© OpenMapTiles" linked to https://openmaptiles.org/, next to
"© OpenStreetMap contributors" linked to https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.
